<title>JAPAN: Chiyoda rises sharply on buy-backs.</title>
<headline>Chiyoda rises sharply on buy-backs.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Chiyoda Corp  rose sharply on the Tokyo Stock Exchange in Tuesday's morning session as participants bought back the shares after selling on margin, brokers said.</p>
<p>The shares were up 30 yen at 570 yen as of 0134 GMT.  </p>
<p>&quot;The issue is not attractive considering the company's business performance, but some players who had been taking profits on margin selling are now buying back,&quot; a market analyst at a medium-sized brokerage said.</p>
</text>
